  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dairy trade mission to the Netherlands</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A 4-day dairy production and processing trade mission to the Netherlands is planned for March-April 2022. There were two previous missions, in 2016 and 2019, that emphasized processing, particularly cheese and yoghurt production.The Pakistani dairy sector lacks diversification, technology in milk processing and cheese production and a need for knowledge and business exchange to promote new techniques. This mission is trying to address these by including individual matchmaking, a knowledge seminar, networking, company visits and exchanges, with government and knowledge institutes.</narrative>
  </description>
